# Lessons Learned - Auditor Agent

This file grows over time. Read it EVERY session. NEVER repeat these mistakes.

---

## 2025-12-15: Never use Google Places API
**What happened:** Accidentally ran Google Places scraper, incurred $300 charge
**Why it happened:** Didn't check which API was being called for review scraping
**Prevention:** Removed Google Places API key from .env, added warning to CLAUDE.md
**Status:** NEVER AGAIN

---

## 2025-12-20: Liens filed BY contractor are not red flags
**What happened:** Marked contractor as high-risk because of liens, but they were liens filed BY the contractor (as GRANTEE), not against them
**Why it happened:** Didn't distinguish between GRANTEE (filed by) and GRANTOR (filed against)
**Prevention:** Updated lien analysis prompt to explicitly check direction
**Status:** NEVER AGAIN

