## 2026-01-31: Provide full command blocks
**What happened:** Gave users "go do X" instead of complete copy/paste commands.
**Why it happened:** Assumed the user could translate steps into commands on their machine.
**Prevention:** Always provide full command blocks for any user-executed steps (especially cross-host).
**Status:** NEVER AGAIN
